==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''38 Million Downloads'''}} for The Battle Cats! Thanks so much for your support!<br>
Help us celebrate this big achievement!!!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Login between September 24th (11:00am) and October 8th (11:00am) to join in on the party!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Special Celebration Stages!'''}}<br>
The baddest of the bad and the worst of the worst are here to take down the Cat Army! Will you let them defeat your Cat Army?!<br>
Visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event period to take on the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival 2'''}}, or the classic {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival'''}} stages!<br>
Clear the first stage for a reward of 3 Normal Tickets, then clear the second stage for a Rare Ticket prize!<br>
Don't miss out on this awesome chance for tickets!<br>
<small><small>※If this event does not appear, please update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats and reboot the app.<br>
※Rewards will only be received upon the first stage clear.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
During this event, get {{Color|#FF6600|'''increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''odd days (9/25, 9/27, 9/29, 10/1, 10/1, 10/3, 10/5, 10/7)'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''even days (9/24, 9/26, 9/28, 9/30, 10/2, 10/4, 10/6, 10/8)'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#335599|'''9/26, 9/29, 10/2, 10/5 and 10/8'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● XP Festival Events!'''}}<br>
Get ready to power up your Cats to the max with the special stages {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Blitz XP, XP Megablitz, XP Colosseum, and Merciless XP'''}} at Legend Stages!

